  "en": "The female reproductive system",
  "kn": "ಸ್ತ್ರೀ ಸಂತಾನೋತ್ಪತ್ತಿ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Where does a baby grow?",
    "kn": "ಶಿಶು ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತದೆ?"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "The female system does more than make eggs: it receives sperm, hosts fertilisation, nurtures the foetus and feeds the newborn.",
    "kn": "ಸ್ತ್ರೀ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ ಅಂಡಾಣು ತಯಾರಿಸುವುದಷ್ಟೇ ಅಲ್ಲ; ನಿಷೇಚನ, ಭ್ರೂಣದ ಬೆಳವಣಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತು ಶಿಶುವಿನ ಪೋಷಣೆಗೂ ನೆರವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "The female system does more than make eggs: it receives sperm, hosts fertilisation, nurtures the foetus and feeds the newborn.",
    "kn": "ಸ್ತ್ರೀ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ ಅಂಡಾಣು ತಯಾರಿಸುವುದಷ್ಟೇ ಅಲ್ಲ; ನಿಷೇಚನ, ಭ್ರೂಣದ ಬೆಳವಣಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತು ಶಿಶುವಿನ ಪೋಷಣೆಗೂ ನೆರವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Ovaries, oviducts and uterus"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The ovaries are the primary female sex organs, each 2–4 cm long; they produce ova and hormones. Each oviduct (fallopian tube) has a funnel-shaped infundibulum with finger-like fimbriae that collect the ovum, a wider ampulla and a narrow isthmus that joins the uterus. The uterus wall has three layers: the outer perimetrium, the thick muscular myometrium that contracts during delivery, and the inner glandular endometrium that changes during the menstrual cycle. The cervix opens into the vagina; together they form the birth canal.",
    "kn": "ಅಂಡಾಶಯಗಳು ಪ್ರಾಥಮಿಕ ಸ್ತ್ರೀ ಲೈಂಗಿಕ ಅಂಗಗಳು. ಅಂಡನಾಳದಲ್ಲಿ ಇನ್‌ಫಂಡಿಬುಲಮ್, ಆಂಪುಲ್ಲಾ ಮತ್ತು ಇಸ್ತ್ಮಸ್ ಭಾಗಗಳಿವೆ. ಗರ್ಭಾಶಯದ ಗೋಡೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪೆರಿಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್, ಮಯೋಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್ ಮತ್ತು ಎಂಡೋಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್ ಪದರಗಳಿವೆ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Oviduct: infundibulum (fimbriae) → ampulla → isthmus"
    },
    {
     "en": "Uterus wall: perimetrium, myometrium, endometrium"
    },
    {
     "en": "Cervical canal + vagina = birth canal"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The ovaries are the primary female sex organs, each 2–4 cm long; they produce ova and hormones. Each oviduct (fallopian tube) has a funnel-shaped infundibulum with finger-like fimbriae that collect the ovum, a wider ampulla and a narrow isthmus that joins the uterus. The uterus wall has three layers: the outer perimetrium, the thick muscular myometrium that contracts during delivery, and the inner glandular endometrium that changes during the menstrual cycle. The cervix opens into the vagina; together they form the birth canal.",
    "kn": "ಅಂಡಾಶಯಗಳು ಪ್ರಾಥಮಿಕ ಸ್ತ್ರೀ ಲೈಂಗಿಕ ಅಂಗಗಳು. ಅಂಡನಾಳದಲ್ಲಿ ಇನ್‌ಫಂಡಿಬುಲಮ್, ಆಂಪುಲ್ಲಾ ಮತ್ತು ಇಸ್ತ್ಮಸ್ ಭಾಗಗಳಿವೆ. ಗರ್ಭಾಶಯದ ಗೋಡೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪೆರಿಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್, ಮಯೋಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್ ಮತ್ತು ಎಂಡೋಮೆಟ್ರಿಯಮ್ ಪದರಗಳಿವೆ."
   }
  },
